  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is focused on scaling-up commercial investment in tropical agricultural supply chains while transforming them to deforestation-free and socially inclusive practices at a landscape level. Investments target forest and peat conservation and restoration embedded in landscapes through      sustainable and regenerative agriculture. Target sectors are the major supply chains driving deforestation, including livestock, palm oil, soy, rubber, cocoa and forestry.</narrative>
  </description>
